  "scope": "Explicit Darwin AArch64 C call-site prototypes retain their authenticated branch and physical argument/result pieces, including logical 128-bit, direct aggregate/HFA and indirect argument values. This is a controlled-model qualification, not complete arm64e support.",
  "initial_base_revision": "671ceba93664fb74051bc7508c255102003ff0f3",
