  "changes": [
    "Reuse the original-storage machine-call bridge for authenticated explicit Darwin C value calls. Store each direct result register at its declared width and reconstruct logical values through shared ABI members.",
    "Evaluate each logical HighIR argument once; copy its declared ABI pieces by offset without copying record padding. Preserve the original physical-operand convention for x8 hidden results.",
    "Keep raw direct-result calls on their typed path, retain potentially unwinding assembly and the compiler frame, and reject missing carriers. Generic and recovered-native C calls retain their separately documented behavior.",
    "Require the original exception class on every typed model route, including HighC/LLVMC O0; remove all intermediate-resign allowances from this profile.",
    "Remove successful SDK products and owned model installations after recording results; retain active build state, canonical model inputs and required source/log diagnostics."
  ],
